<title>USA: Recycling Industries Inc Q1 full results.</title>
<headline>Recycling Industries Inc Q1 full results.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Recycling Industries, Inc.</p>
<p>	   Unaudited Consolidated Condensed Statement of Income</p>
<p>						  Three Months Ended:</p>
<p>						    December 31,</p>
<p>							1996	    1995</p>
<p>					     (Unaudited)    (Unaudited)</p>
<p>Revenues:</p>
<p>   Sales				   $10,216,000     $3,458,000</p>
<p>   Brokerage				   545,000		---</p>
<p>   Other Income				  8,000		---</p>
<p>	Total revenues		    10,769,000	3,458,000</p>
<p>Cost and Expenses:</p>
<p>   Cost of Sales			   8,928,000	3,053,000</p>
<p>   Cost of brokerage			 524,000		---</p>
<p>   Cost of Sales - related party	     ---	  362,000</p>
<p>   Personnel				   651,000	  431,000</p>
<p>   Professional services		    50,000	  143,000</p>
<p>   Travel					 28,000	   17,000</p>
<p>   Occupancy				    62,000	   14,000</p>
<p>   Depreciation and amortization	 227,000	   31,000</p>
<p>   Interest				    459,000	   96,000</p>
<p>   Other general and administrative    195,000	  120,000</p>
<p>	Total Costs and Expenses	11,124,000	4,267,000</p>
<p> Loss before income taxes		(355,000)	(809,000)</p>
<p> Income taxes (benefit)			  ---	(441,000)</p>
<p> Net loss				    (355,000)	(368,000)</p>
<p> Net loss per share before taxes	  (0.03)	   (0.10)</p>
<p> Net loss per share after taxes	   (0.03)	   (0.04)</p>
<p>Weighted average shares outstanding</p>
<p>						13,892,084	8,460,733</p>
<p>The presentation of financial information by the Company includes partial allocation of depreciation expense in the cost of sales as reported in the Consolidated Statements of Operations.  The Company reported EBITDA of $636,000 for the first quarter of 1997 based upon a loss before income taxes of $(355,000) plus interest expense of $459,000 as reported in the Consolidated Statements of Operations and depreciation expense of $532,000 as reported in the Statements of Cash Flows.  The Company reported negative EBITDA of $(540,000) for the first quarter of 1996 based upon a loss before income taxes of $(809,000) plus interest expense of $96,000 as reported in the Consolidated Statements of Operations and depreciation expense of $173,000 as reported in the Statements of Cash Flows. SOURCE  Recycling Industries, Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
